        <mxCell id="q0" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#272B4D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#272B4D;dashed=1;" value="• É a análise e a base certas?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O código é o mesmo da rodada?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Os arquivos estão íntegros?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A unidade é candidata na triagem?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Algum erro monitorado mudou?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="226" width="169" x="245" y="-199" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="q1" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=11;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#272B4D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#272B4D;" value="• O erro existe, e qual o tamanho?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Qual é a lição?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A regra cobre o bastante?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Outro cálculo confirma?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O arquivo da memória está no formato?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Sai sem dado do cliente?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="228" width="178" x="424" y="-201" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="q3" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#272B4D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#272B4D;" value="• Serve a este ambiente?&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O prompt manda o contrário?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O prompt já diz isso?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Recorre o bastante?&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;• A lição cobre todos os erros?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="236" width="169" x="801.5" y="-201" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="q4" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#272B4D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#272B4D;" value="• &lt;font&gt;Que lições aparecem nos erros?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;• O pesquisador aprova a lista de lições?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;• Dois leitores, às cegas, concordam? As lições são únicas?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;• &amp;nbsp;Existe uma regra que acha o padrão e quantas ocorrências ela cobre?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;• &amp;nbsp;O pesquisador aprova a lição e o destino?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
